  "post_content": "<p>La tarde de este viernes se ha inaugurado&nbsp;en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda&nbsp;una exposici&oacute;n con obras de la colecci&oacute;n del prestigioso artista borriolense, residente en Castell&oacute;n,&nbsp;Lorenzo Ram&iacute;rez.. Estar&aacute; abierta hasta&nbsp;el 1 de mayo. Adem&aacute;s, la inauguraci&oacute;n ha contado con&nbsp;el concierto de un&nbsp;cuarteto de cuerda de la Societat Art&iacute;stico-musical Vila d&#39;Onda (SAMVO), que ha amenizado la exposici&oacute;n mientras la visitaban las personas asistentes.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0583.jpg\" alt=\"img_0583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0586.jpg\" alt=\"img_0586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0587.jpg\" alt=\"img_0587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0588.jpg\" alt=\"img_0588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0589.jpg\" alt=\"img_0589\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0591.jpg\" alt=\"img_0591\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0592.jpg\" alt=\"img_0592\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/inaugexpolorenzoramirez110414/img_0593.jpg\" alt=\"img_0593\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e